  "stop_gate_passed": true,
  "translated_poem": "I fear that,  \nYou might lose me.  \nI am a woman,  \nWho doesn’t know how to live without you again.  \n\nI fear that,  \nYou might walk away from me.  \nAs much as I want,  \nI can’t have you as I wish.  \n\nWhat should I do now?  \nI want you, you who are my destiny.",
